READING: if dim-1 sets are tight/near-tight (L small) while dim-2,3 GAPs are LOOSE (L~0.1) EVEN AT
HIGH E, then FREIMAN DIMENSION -- not additive energy -- is the loneliness parameter. The AP is the
unique TIGHT extremal because it is the unique dimension-1 minimal set (aligned resonances).
